# MASTER PROMPT: VILLOTHAR — OFFICIAL WEBSITE, CUSTOMER PORTAL & NETWORK MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

## 1. Project Overview

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, product architect, and network systems designer.

Build a modern, responsive, professional web platform for **VilloThar**, a village-owned internet service initiative designed to provide affordable internet connectivity to rural communities in Tharparkar, Sindh, Pakistan.

VilloThar is not just an ordinary internet service provider website. It needs a complete digital platform through which:

- People can learn about VilloThar and its services.
- Customers can register and verify their identity.
- Customers can register individual devices.
- Customers can purchase internet packages for their registered devices.
- Devices can be associated with their MAC addresses.
- The system can manage package validity and network authorization.
- Customers can manage their accounts, devices, subscriptions, payments, and support requests.
- Administrators can manage customers, devices, packages, payments, network sessions, and network operations.

The platform should be designed as a real-world product that can eventually be connected to physical networking equipment, payment services, and authorized identity-verification services.

Do not build only a visual mockup. Build a functional, well-structured application with realistic workflows and a backend-ready architecture.

